{"id":106324368467440,"name":"Lost Currents [Alpha]  ","desc":"Lost Currents \n\nSail a boat with your friends and dive into the deep depths of the AZR sea. You venture down in an old diving helmet, searching for gold bars while the others watch the boat. But beware, predators lurk below, and the ocean holds dark secrets.\nWork together to survive, uncover mysteries, and see how far your courage will take you.\n\nTrial and error will be your guide.\n\nUpdate v0.10.3\n-Many bug fixes (too many to list here\nUse code \"BUGFIX\" for some gold\n\nUpdate v0.10.2\nNew UI for the lobby\nExpanded map with new islands\nNew boat: Sailboat (uses the sail as alternative mechanic for movement)\nNew craftable item: Defibrillator (revive teammates)\nUpon death, players now respawn on a lifesaver where they can be revived\nGiftbringer receives exclusive Christmas items \nBoat movement stabilized for smoother sailing\nNew consumable: Coconut (found on islands)\nNew barrel animation\nNew effects while driving the boat\nFixed: Workbench now gives items even if inventory is full","path":"/game/106324368467440-lost-currents-alpha","slug":"106324368467440-lost-currents-alpha","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-111861f885e87d38b97fce508b2e79bf/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7805bc51c9e26be63aaf4347da06ba5a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":86,"visitor":49315827,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-25T12:00:03.388Z","creator":{"name":"flMindworks","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":7,"freeCount":7,"keyCount":4,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Lost-Currents-Alpha-autofarm-206251","_id":"69ecacc3e3e402ee38ead349","title":"autofarm","game":{"_id":"68474d0d343da7b99761b304","gameId":106324368467440,"name":"Lost Currents [Alpha]  ","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-7805bc51c9e26be63aaf4347da06ba5a-b749a18216b6.png","placeId":106324368467440},"features":"autofarm\nai class\nhttps://discord.gg/CXnr6EXpt